        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Grab my hand. Are you okay?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "I'm fine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "What was that? Those beasts went down in the blink of an eye..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Originium Arts using this Arts Unit. My own special trick."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "Tch... parlor tricks."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "The traps will slow the rest. Leave them to Sumoto's group. We can head over to the other side, where the defenses are thinner... Take it easy, old man."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "Cut the crap."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "What's with that look on your face?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "No, just thinking back to the days when us hunters fought side by side."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "It's been seven years, and this is the first time you haven't told me to get lost or called me a traitor."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "I... I didn't think you would really take up..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "Akira's hunting spear. You can say it. I know you were Akira's mentor. You didn't think I would go kill those beasts?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "You weren't a hunter at the time, and you objected to Akira becoming one. His sacrifice changed you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "I'm glad you noticed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Old man, there's something... Perhaps you've misunderstood all this time, and I wasn't sure how to tell you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "I didn't abandon him to die."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "Lure powder."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "You knew?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "I'm his father."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "That idiot sacrificed himself to protect your mine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "I still remember the look on his face that day, his eyes, his every move..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "The cries of the beasts were everywhere. He opened his mouth to say something, but it was drowned out by the noise. I remember his pale lips..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Could he have been saying..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
