    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Akira!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Kusso, where did all these beasts come from? What did you do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Don't tell me you\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Stay away, master! Don't follow me, no matter what!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Come back! We'll stop them here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "No, master! You should know better than anyone!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "We can't stop an outbreak like this... many people will be hurt, even killed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "The Originium mine would be destroyed. Everything you've worked for would be lost. I can't let that happen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Weren't you against the mine? Just let it burn!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Come back! Your life matters more!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "The beasts are gathering."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Time is short, master."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Yes, I was against the mine. Originium is unknown and dangerous. It will bring disaster we can't even predict."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "I also can't forgive the taking of innocent lives. This was the inevitable result of you failing to respect nature and letting greed take over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "But I also remember the day we went into the city together and saw the high-rise buildings. The bright lights and shining signs, all made possible by Originium..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Originium is valuable. It will lift the village out of poverty, become the pillar of our livelihood... We've come this far. Don't let this opportunity go to waste."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Akira!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Wasn't it you who taught me that a hunter must fight for the survival of his clan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Out of the way, you damned beasts!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "This beast outbreak is the wrath of nature."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "But I'm also fighting for survival. We stare each other in the eyes as equals."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Promise me one last thing, master."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Lead the others."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "Survive."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii",
        "text": "Come back, Akira!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_760_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Akira Kashiwau",
        "text": "And please pass this on to my father, that stubborn old timer."
    },
